    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 1
    requiredQuestID: 2
    questMustBeCompleted: 1
  - speakerName: 'Alan:'
    line: "\"He finally dig a hole too deep?\u201D "
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "\u201CHe went out diving and hasn\u2019t come back. I\u2019m trying to
      track him down.\u201D "
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
  - speakerName: 'Alan:'
    line: "\u201CFigures. Either he found what he was lookin\u2019 for\u2026 or it
      found him. My bet? Sea serpent. Or a cursed statue. Or one of those angry barnacles
      that whisper your worst fears. Y\u2019know, island stuff. You need a ride out
      to his dive spots? I could take you. For a price, of course\u2014I run a fine
      service, Alan\u2019s Flight of Fancy \u2014 adventure included, premium snacks
      not.\u201D "
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 1
    questToComplete: 3
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: "\u201CI\u2019m a bit short on funds right now.\u201D"
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
  - speakerName: 'Alan:'
    line: "\u201CTell you what\u2014grab some of them fat crabs off the north beach,
      give \u2018em to Jim on my behalf. He\u2019ll trade his soul for shellfish.
      Just don\u2019t name them. Makes eating 'em weird. Three oughta be enough for
      me to take you to the closest place I\u2019ve seen him go. Do that, and we
      got a deal.\u201D"
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 1
    questToStart: 4
    requiresItem: 1
    requiredItemName: fish
    requiredItemAmount: 3
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
  - speakerName: 'Player:'
    line: '"Got it, three crabs to Jim on your behalf and you''ll take me out. Sounds
      Good, I''ll be back later."'
    choices: []
    completeQuest: 0
    questToComplete: 0
    startQuest: 0
    questToStart: 0
    requiresItem: 0
    requiredItemName: 
    requiredItemAmount: 0
    requiresQuest: 0
    requiredQuestID: 0
    questMustBeCompleted: 0
